Text_en:
Many people are active here, but I want to give special thanks to two people - despite the difference of opinion on some issues - in the middle of the battle, hardworking, knowledgeable, strong, patriotic and aware of enemies. God bless you.
Amir alone  
@tanha1358

Hamza Ghalibi
@HamzeGhalebi
